1
00:00:01,254 --> 00:00:05,504
LANE AUTHORITY BRIEFING: It has no name. Only a title. The Warden.

2
00:00:06,479 --> 00:00:09,129
LANE AUTHORITY BRIEFING: Its voice alone has cracked hulls.

3
00:00:09,279 --> 00:00:11,289
LANE AUTHORITY BRIEFING: Those who have heard it never forget it.

4
00:00:14,002 --> 00:00:15,852
THE WARDEN: STOP! Stop right there!

5
00:00:15,922 --> 00:00:19,372
THE WARDEN: Do you have ANY idea how long it takes to grow a scout?!

6
00:00:22,780 --> 00:00:26,150
THE WARDEN: They don't want the lanes open! They want them OWNED!
